              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ink-muted"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Sınır koymada zorlanma, anne ile baba arasında farklı tutumlar</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-ink-muted"><svg class="w-4 h-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Boşanma, ayrılık ya da yeniden evlilik süreçleri</li>
